---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page
  title="Flood Depth"
  description="Flood Depth maps flood extent, depth, probability and exposed assets anywhere on Earth from a free global DEM, built by Simon Maps in Nairobi, Kenya."
  path="/flood-depth"
  eyebrow="Flood mapping tool"
  site={{ href: 'https://flood.simonmapper.co.ke/', label: 'flood.simonmapper.co.ke' }}
>
  <Fragment slot="hero">
    <p class="lede">Flood exposure from terrain alone: map flood extent, depth, probability and exposed assets anywhere on Earth.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a href="https://flood.simonmapper.co.ke/" class="btn btn-solid">Open Flood Depth</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn">Discuss a project</a>
    </div>
  </Fragment>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What it does</h2>
      <p class="block-intro">Search a town, river or region, draw an area, or pick an example, and see how water would spread across the terrain.</p>
      <div class="features">
        <article class="feature">
          <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9c2 0 2-1.5 4.5-1.5S10 9 12 9s2.5-1.5 4.5-1.5S19 9 21 9"/><path d="M3 15c2 0 2-1.5 4.5-1.5S10 15 12 15s2.5-1.5 4.5-1.5S19 15 21 15"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Extent and depth</h3>
          <p>Where water reaches and how deep it gets, mapped across the area.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19h16"/><path d="M7 16v-4M12 16V8M17 16v-7"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Probability</h3>
          <p>How likely each place is to flood, not just a single yes or no.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21V9l8-5 8 5v12"/><path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Exposed assets</h3>
          <p>What sits inside the flooded area, highlighted on the map.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.7 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.3-3.8 9c-2.5-2.7-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.7 12 3z"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Anywhere on Earth</h3>
          <p>Runs in the browser, with no local GIS software or data downloads.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p class="block-intro">Flood Depth models water from the shape of the land, so it works even where no detailed flood study exists.</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Elevation data</dt><dd>Free global DEM</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Method</dt><dd>HAND and synthetic rating curves</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Coverage</dt><dd>Anywhere on Earth</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Live at</dt><dd><a href="https://flood.simonmapper.co.ke/">flood.simonmapper.co.ke</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
